<title>NEW ZEALAND: F&amp;P reports NZ$19.2 mln half year profit.</title>
<headline>F&amp;P reports NZ$19.2 mln half year profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to Sept 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    19.2 vs 19.4</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 17.0 vs 18.0</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  9.0 vs 9.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				   395.8 vs 398.9</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			     28.9 vs 28.5</p>
<p>    Tax					    9.7 vs 9.9</p>
<p>    Equity earnings			    nil vs 0.8</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	 112.5 vs 110.75</p>
</text>
